 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-05","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.13","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.13/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"713411f20371fb48cf2376e9164d110e71439fe8b743e69b388da18f0568b351"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.13/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"e7b61fb386d4a217d764b880e4a031b24dc2a00c4cbf47d5a6d65d053d51823f"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.13/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"8816211cacbd92d346f2f3a272fdd7406f51c8b024f92c9fdde40d021b3a6088"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.13/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"62847314e84c84ed0c36167730d4a8640e033a558fc4cb696ade43dfdb1df0e2"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.13"}